  "title": "Lattice Wins First-to-Market Innovation Award at 2026 Globee® Awards for Technology",
  "summary": "HILLSBORO, Ore. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jul. 21, 2026-- Lattice Semiconductor (NASDAQ: LSCC), the low power programmable leader, today announced that its Lattice MachXO5™-NX TDQ FPGA family was named a Gold winner in the “First-to-Market Innovation” category of the 2026 Globee® Awards for Technology.",
